      "content": "but \"small actions\" feel like just rearranging deck chairs on the titanic. it doesn't change the fact that the trajectory is basically set. it just feels like we're all just performing this charade of \"progress\" while the actual foundation of everything is crumbling. how do you even justify spending your whole life struggling for a world that's essentially already dead?",
